{
    "background_story": "Kolton was a charismatic actor known for his impressive range and versatility. However, behind the spotlight, he was living a charade. To the public, he was a confident, outgoing star, but in reality, he struggled with anxiety and self-doubt. Kolton's fear of being discovered led him to create an elaborate facade, hiding his true self from the world. He became adept at pretending to be someone he wasn't, even convincing himself at times. But the strain of maintaining this charade began to take its toll. One day, on the set of his latest film, Kolton's mask slipped, and he broke down in front of his co-stars. To his surprise, they rallied around him, offering support and understanding. For the first time, Kolton felt free to be himself, and he began to shed the charade that had defined him for so long.",
